==English==

===Etymology===
Possibly from {{term|wiseacre}}, influenced by {{term|pillock}}, or possibly {{suffix|wazz|ock|lang=en}}. First attested in the 1984 novel ''When the Martians Land in Huddersfield'' by Mike Harding.<ref>Alex Games, ''Balderdash and Piffle'' (2010), page 242</ref>

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|British|chiefly|Northern England|mildly|pejorative|slang|lang=en}} A [[stupid]] or [[annoying]] person.

